### Role: Provides small manual smoke-test requests for the local API.
@NbJewel.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5155

GET {{NbJewel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/items/1/price
Accept: application/json

### Design master list (feeds the design code dropdown)
GET {{NbJewel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs
Accept: application/json

### Variants of an item
GET {{NbJewel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/items/1/variants
Accept: application/json

### Add stock (adds to on-hand, quantity must be above 0)
POST {{NbJewel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/items/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "variantId": 11, "storeId": 1, "quantity": 5 }

### Move status forward (Draft, With Smith, Received, Complete). A bad move returns 409.
PATCH {{NbJewel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/items/11/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "With Smith" }

###
